    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SushiCat: Bento</strong> is a unique game blending <strong>roguelike deckbuilding</strong> with the <strong>tile-matching genre</strong>. Get ready to take risks and show your good taste to rack up the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132830/extras/2ba541e721ccf3032f7c6b7896e12077.avif?t=1749624063\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span>Place sushi tiles strategically to create <strong>mouthwatering combos</strong>. Maximize your score by matching different proteins and sushi types while discovering new flavors to <strong>cook up your recipe for victory</strong>. Each new game is unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132830/extras/067220ca9ed71e53b7f73a197fb8f3f0.avif?t=1749624063\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span>An <strong>adorable tile-based game</strong> that will leave you <strong>&quot;purring&quot; in thought</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new game, <strong>discover and unlock</strong> new tiles and bonuses to <strong>perfect your bento</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132830/extras/389171a2b92f3be0699896367f60b7f2.avif?t=1749624063\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span>Use a variety of elements: <strong>unique perks</strong> in every game, <strong>special tiles</strong>, and <strong>upgrades</strong>. Craft an <strong>epic bento box</strong> packed with flavors to score big and unlock even more upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Animated banner]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>An endless playground!</strong> Break the game with <strong>insane combos</strong> all over the grid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Carry-over combos</strong> across grids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Special tiles, upgrades, and bonuses</strong> to spice up your matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the delicious and adorable world of SushiCat.</strong><br>A cozy atmosphere awaits you, filled with <strong>purring SushiCats</strong> and <strong>scrumptious delights</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your bento and <strong>discover how to combine different proteins</strong> to score the most points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>adorable hand-drawn visuals</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% vegetarian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Animated banner]</strong><br><strong>SushiCat: Bento</strong> was lovingly crafted by a duo of game developers from <strong>R\u00e9union Island</strong>.<br>Together, we founded <strong>Titang Studio</strong>, with the dream of creating <strong>original and high-quality indie games</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your <strong>constructive feedback</strong>, so don\u2019t hesitate to reach out.<br>We\u2019ll do our best to reply to your messages <strong>:3</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63 <strong>Bon app\u00e9tit!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SushiCat: Bento</strong> is a unique game blending <strong>roguelike deckbuilding</strong> with the <strong>tile-matching genre</strong>. Get ready to take risks and show your good taste to rack up the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132830/extras/2ba541e721ccf3032f7c6b7896e12077.avif?t=1749624063\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span>Place sushi tiles strategically to create <strong>mouthwatering combos</strong>. Maximize your score by matching different proteins and sushi types while discovering new flavors to <strong>cook up your recipe for victory</strong>. Each new game is unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132830/extras/067220ca9ed71e53b7f73a197fb8f3f0.avif?t=1749624063\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span>An <strong>adorable tile-based game</strong> that will leave you <strong>&quot;purring&quot; in thought</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new game, <strong>discover and unlock</strong> new tiles and bonuses to <strong>perfect your bento</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132830/extras/389171a2b92f3be0699896367f60b7f2.avif?t=1749624063\" data-has-big width=800 height=195 /></span>Use a variety of elements: <strong>unique perks</strong> in every game, <strong>special tiles</strong>, and <strong>upgrades</strong>. Craft an <strong>epic bento box</strong> packed with flavors to score big and unlock even more upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Animated banner]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>An endless playground!</strong> Break the game with <strong>insane combos</strong> all over the grid!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Carry-over combos</strong> across grids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Special tiles, upgrades, and bonuses</strong> to spice up your matches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the delicious and adorable world of SushiCat.</strong><br>A cozy atmosphere awaits you, filled with <strong>purring SushiCats</strong> and <strong>scrumptious delights</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your bento and <strong>discover how to combine different proteins</strong> to score the most points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>adorable hand-drawn visuals</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% vegetarian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Animated banner]</strong><br><strong>SushiCat: Bento</strong> was lovingly crafted by a duo of game developers from <strong>R\u00e9union Island</strong>.<br>Together, we founded <strong>Titang Studio</strong>, with the dream of creating <strong>original and high-quality indie games</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your <strong>constructive feedback</strong>, so don\u2019t hesitate to reach out.<br>We\u2019ll do our best to reply to your messages <strong>:3</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63 <strong>Bon app\u00e9tit!</strong></p>",
